            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nThe name `ensure_languages` was deliberately chosen to mean that \"these are the languages that will work with tree-sitter\". It means that their parser will be ensured installed and that they are enabled in relevant buffers.\n\nI'll think of a better way to make this clearer. Perhaps go back to my first candidate `languages` (which is still used in the comment) and mention that these will have parsers installed and enabled when needed.\n",
